# 3: Generator started -> FULL LIGHTS RESTORED! Objective: Access Research Archive.
# 4: Archive door unlocked with the 5-digit experiment passcode. Objective: Enter Archive Core.
# 5: Master Echo Terminal activated -> The Truth Revealed! (Victory)
